Output/

# Generated dashboard — committing this at repo root is PLAN.md step 7's
# job (deploy plumbing), not step 6 (render.py just needs to be able to
# generate it). Dynamic content (prices/scores/timestamp) would also make
# every test run a noisy diff before there's an actual publish mechanism.
# Anchored with a leading slash: a bare "index.html" matches in every
# directory and would silently drop committed hub pages such as
# business-models/index.html.
/index.html